msgid ""
"**New skills for agents** &mdash; Whether you are migrating to the new "
"client-side Sampler and Estimator, or migrating old notebooks that still use"
" V1 primitives, the migrate-qiskit-ibm-runtime skill in the "
"[Qiskit/skills](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) repository can simplify "
"the task. This new open-source repository contains official, IBM-verified "
"agent skills for building IBM Quantum and Qiskit workflows. We will be "
"adding more skills to this repository in the near future.\n"
